{"seq":1,"slug":"embedding-recall","title":"Embedding 与双塔召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning/embedding-recall","wordCount":1618,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"embedding-与双塔召回\">Embedding 与双塔召回</h1><p>推荐系统的第一道生死关是召回：在几十毫秒内从上亿候选里捞回几千个值得精排的物品。暴力地给每个候选打分在这个规模下是天方夜谭——一亿次模型前向计算根本来不及。双塔模型是工业界对这道难题的标准答案，它把<a href=\"../classic-methods/matrix-factorization\">矩阵分解</a>的内积思想升级为深度网络，再借助近似最近邻检索把毫秒级在线召回变成现实。本篇讲清这套现代召回的核心引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>双塔模型把用户和物品分别用两个独立的神经网络（两座「塔」）编码成同一空间里的向量，用户向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 与物品向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的内积（或余弦）即偏好分数。关键在于两座塔在打分时彼此不交互——这个「解耦」约束看似削弱表达力，却是整套架构能在亿级规模运行的根本前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户特征&lt;br/&gt;画像/行为序列] --&gt; B[用户塔 DNN]&#10;  C[物品特征&lt;br/&gt;ID/类目/内容] --&gt; D[物品塔 DNN]&#10;  B --&gt; E[用户向量 u]&#10;  D --&gt; F[物品向量 v]&#10;  E --&gt; G[内积/余弦打分]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; H[离线全库编码]&#10;  H --&gt; I[ANN 索引&lt;br/&gt;HNSW/IVF]&#10;  E --&gt; J[在线实时编码]&#10;  J --&gt; K[ANN 检索 Top-K]&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L[召回结果送精排]\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户特征&lt;br/&gt;画像/行为序列] --&gt; B[用户塔 DNN]\n  C[物品特征&lt;br/&gt;ID/类目/内容] --&gt; D[物品塔 DNN]\n  B --&gt; E[用户向量 u]\n  D --&gt; F[物品向量 v]\n  E --&gt; G[内积/余弦打分]\n  F --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; H[离线全库编码]\n  H --&gt; I[ANN 索引&lt;br/&gt;HNSW/IVF]\n  E --&gt; J[在线实时编码]\n  J --&gt; K[ANN 检索 Top-K]\n  I --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L[召回结果送精排]</pre><p>下表对比双塔召回与上一章方法的演进关系，可以看出它如何继承又超越了矩阵分解：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>矩阵分解</th>\n<th>双塔模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户/物品表示</td>\n<td>静态隐向量（查表）</td>\n<td>DNN 编码的动态向量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用特征</td>\n<td>仅 ID</td>\n<td>ID + 画像 + 序列 + 内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>无新 ID 向量则失效</td>\n<td>可用内容特征泛化到新物品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打分方式</td>\n<td>内积</td>\n<td>内积/余弦（保持解耦）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线检索</td>\n<td>同样可用 ANN</td>\n<td>ANN（HNSW/IVF/ScaNN）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么必须是-双塔-而非-单塔\">为什么必须是「双塔」而非「单塔」</h2><p>精排模型（见<a href=\"ranking-models\">排序模型与 CTR 预估</a>）会把用户特征和物品特征拼在一起、让它们在网络里充分交叉，这样表达力最强。那召回为何不也这么做？答案是规模。单塔模型每给一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 打分都要跑一次完整前向，一亿候选就是一亿次前向，在线根本扛不住。</p>\n<p>双塔的解耦正是为了破解这一点：因为用户塔和物品塔独立，物品向量可以离线把全库一次性算好、灌进索引；线上来一个用户只算一次用户向量，剩下的就是一次向量检索，而不是一亿次模型推理。代价是表达力的牺牲——用户与物品的交互只能发生在最后那个内积里，无法在网络深处交叉。这就是召回与排序的本质分工：召回用解耦换规模，排序用交叉换精度。这一分工是<a href=\"../systems-practice/recall-rank-architecture\">召回-排序-重排架构</a>的设计基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练目标与负采样\">训练目标与负采样</h2><p>双塔模型的训练几乎总是基于<a href=\"../foundations/data-feedback\">隐式反馈</a>的对比学习：拉近用户与其交互过的正样本物品向量，推远与负样本的向量。工业界最常用 in-batch softmax——把同一个 batch 内其他用户的正样本当作当前用户的负样本，省去单独采负的开销：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>B</mi></munderover><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = -\\frac{1}{B}\\sum_{i=1}^{B} \\log \\frac{\\exp(u_i^\\top v_i / \\tau)}{\\sum_{j=1}^{B} \\exp(u_i^\\top v_j / \\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1354em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.307em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度系数。但 in-batch 负采样有个隐患：batch 里的负样本是按流行度采来的（热门物品更可能出现在 batch 中），导致热门物品被过度当作负例而被压制，需要做 logQ 校正——从打分中减去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log p(j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（物品被采为负例的概率）来纠偏：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{ij} = u_i^\\top v_j - \\log p(j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1852em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这与<a href=\"../foundations/data-feedback\">数据篇</a>讲的负采样分布、流行度偏差是同一脉络的问题。校正不当会让召回结果要么全是爆款、要么全是冷门，二者都损害体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"近似最近邻检索-让毫秒召回成真\">近似最近邻检索：让毫秒召回成真</h2><p>有了物品向量库，召回就转化为一个向量检索问题：给定用户向量，找出库中内积最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个物品。精确求解（暴力扫全库）在亿级规模仍太慢，于是用近似最近邻（ANN）索引牺牲一点精度换取数量级的加速。</p>\n<p>主流的 ANN 方案有三类。基于图的 HNSW 构建多层导航图，查询时从粗到细贪心搜索，召回率与速度俱佳，是当前最流行的选择。基于量化的 IVF-PQ 先聚类分桶、再用乘积量化压缩向量，内存占用极小，适合超大规模。Google 的 ScaNN 则在量化基础上优化了内积检索的各向异性损失。下面这张对照让选型有据可依：HNSW 召回率高但内存大，IVF-PQ 省内存但精度略低，实际系统常按候选规模与内存预算组合使用。这些索引把单次召回压到个位数毫秒，是双塔架构能上线的最后一块拼图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多路召回与新范式\">多路召回与新范式</h2><p>真实系统从不只靠一路双塔召回，而是多路召回并行：双塔向量召回主攻个性化，再叠加协同过滤召回、热门召回、新品召回、地理召回等，各路结果合并去重后送精排。多路的意义在于互补——单一召回源总有盲区，多路才能兼顾相关、新颖与覆盖。</p>\n<p>2024 年以来，召回范式本身也在松动。生成式召回把「找相似向量」改为「自回归地生成物品 ID」，让一个序列模型直接输出推荐结果，HSTU 等工作把召回与排序统一进同一个生成模型（来源：arxiv.org/abs/2402.17152）。这是对双塔「编码-检索」范式的根本性挑战，其模型机制属于<a href=\"sequence-graph\">序列与图推荐</a>。但就当下的主流生产系统而言，双塔加 ANN 仍是召回层无可争议的主力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>召回要在毫秒内从亿级候选捞回几千个，暴力打分不可行，双塔模型是工业标准答案。</li>\n<li>双塔把用户与物品用两个独立 DNN 编码到同一空间，靠解耦换规模：物品向量离线入索引，线上只算一次用户向量。</li>\n<li>召回用解耦换规模、排序用交叉换精度，这一分工是召回-排序架构的设计基石。</li>\n<li>训练用 in-batch softmax 对比学习，须做 logQ 校正以纠正热门物品被过度当负例的偏差。</li>\n<li>ANN 索引（HNSW/IVF-PQ/ScaNN）把检索压到毫秒；真实系统用多路召回互补，生成式召回是 2024 年以来的新挑战者。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Embedding 与双塔召回","id":"embedding-与双塔召回"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么必须是「双塔」而非「单塔」","id":"为什么必须是-双塔-而非-单塔"},{"level":2,"text":"训练目标与负采样","id":"训练目标与负采样"},{"level":2,"text":"近似最近邻检索：让毫秒召回成真","id":"近似最近邻检索-让毫秒召回成真"},{"level":2,"text":"多路召回与新范式","id":"多路召回与新范式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基于内容与混合推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/classic-methods/content-based"},"next":{"title":"排序模型与 CTR 预估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning/ranking-models"}}